stateDiagram-v2
accTitle: Migrating a writable Single-AZ share
accDescr: Bulk and incremental copies happen before a brief write freeze, with verification required before clients switch to the Multi-AZ destination.
[*] --> SourceActive
SourceActive: Single-AZ source owns writes
SourceActive --> Copying: Create Multi-AZ destination
Copying: Initial copy and repeated incremental tasks while source changes
Copying --> Frozen: Begin cutover window
Frozen: Source writes paused
Frozen --> Verified: Final transfer passes validation
Frozen --> SourceActive: Abort cutover safely
Verified --> DestinationActive: Repoint clients
DestinationActive: Multi-AZ destination owns writes
DestinationActive --> [*]
